WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:07.980
Previously on 
The Reflection

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.870
Jennifer Allen, who went missing in New York,

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:07.400
and May Allen from Dayton.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.380
I was researching both of them.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.860
And?

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.970
Michelle Allen, age 32.

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.320
Lives in New Orleans.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.480
New Orleans?

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:17.920
Jazz!

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.250
Did something happen to Michelle?

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:26.130
I didn't know that she was a Reflected.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.200
They took her.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.780
Merchant and Trader.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:36.130
You should be kidnapped by 
Merchant and Trader, too.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.460
It's a Reflected!

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:40.210
It's a Ref!

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:41.960
Mr. Dallas, there's a Ref.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.290
The Reflected should deal 
with the Reflected.

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.730
Then Eleanor was...

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:57.810
Michelle Allen might have also...

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:00.800
Huh? Aren't you worried about Eleanor?

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.530
Never mind!

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.030
I'll go look for Eleanor!

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.240
I'm sorry for forcibly bringing you here.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.560
It's all right.

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:33.530
Where am I?

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:46.150
Don't worry.

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:52.560
So you weren't kidnapping 
these people to kill them.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:57.990
On that day, many people with 
powers were born in our cities.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.570
And eventually,

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:03.800
people started to fear us.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:07.940
That fear began to grow daily.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.490
Once it's known that someone is a Reflected,

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:14.840
some people become horribly violent 
against them, then claim self-defense.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:18.310
The violence eventually reached us here.

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:20.630
There were countless victims.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:25.170
The police also started to 
join in and attack us.

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:26.600
And that's why...

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:31.240
Yes, that's why I acted before they could.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:34.850
I searched for Reflected, found them, 
and sheltered them.

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:39.390
Then... Michelle Allen is here?

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:23.720
So noisy! This isn't jazz!

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:44.010
Eleanor...

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:05.860
How...

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:24.760
Finally, jazz!

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:58.250
Hey, what the hell are you looking at?

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:02.660
Oh, now you've done it!

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:20.220
Thank you.

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:22.880
Well, someone protected me, too.

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:24.860
Really? Who?

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.650
Huh? No, it's...

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:38.780
It amazes me how Reflected haters 
seem to have infinite appetites.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:47.820
This town is completely different 
by day and by night.

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.390
But both are the truth.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.810
I'm Michelle.

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:02.860
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:07.770
Huh? Safe? I'm trapped here.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:09.800
I didn't even do anything.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:14.010
You were being targeted, and your 
relatives have gone missing, too.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:18.030
So what? That has nothing to do with me!

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.030
I'm not a Reflected!

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:24.720
And yet...

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:27.220
Why? Why?!

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:30.460
Let me go back home!

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:35.790
Vy!

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.830
She's a Reflected.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.870
How do you know that for sure?

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.600
3 Years Ago

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.610
3 Years Ago
New Orleans, America 
1:00 AM

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:22.950
Don't worry, Vy. I'll make 
it back a hundred-fold.

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:52.360
Michael... Why did you spend that money?

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:03.190
Vy!

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:05.140
Vy!

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:07.540
Are you here?

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:11.790
Vy!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.520
Michael...

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:16.800
Michael!

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:20.290
Please forgive me, Vy.

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:26.730
Michael...

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:28.480
Vy!

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:41.540
It was then that I lost my sight 
and gained my powers.

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:46.280
Those powers forced light into my darkness.

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:50.180
My eyes can only see the Reflected now,

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:52.190
and that world is a cruel one...

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:57.850
because I have to watch as 
the one I love changes.

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:01.510
Vy...

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:05.820
So Vy is in here?

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:09.490
This is the shell of her soul 
that she's locked herself within.

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:14.060
She loathed me, couldn't forgive 
me, and refused me.

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:16.190
And yet, it's so ironic.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:21.310
Perhaps it's a conditioned reflex, 
but she tries to protect me.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.070
She acts on my words.

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:29.120
So Vy was exposed to the smoke 
during the Reflection?

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:34.080
I've seen many Reflected 
with my sightless eyes.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:39.880
And now, I can differentiate between the 
Reflected who were exposed to the light

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:42.440
and those exposed to the smoke, by their light.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:46.530
Everyone here was exposed to the light.

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:51.350
Those exposed to the smoke 
want nothing to do with us.

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:55.300
They are selfish and devoted 
to their violent tendencies.

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:57.860
They will not hesitate to kill.

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.830
And among us, Vy is...

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:04.830
The Reflected exposed to the smoke...

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:08.760
What if someone to lead them appeared?

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:10.290
To lead them?

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:13.680
Some of them are on the move.

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:16.930
There are Reflected gathering other Reflected.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:20.000
I don't know why,

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:23.800
but it's not to hide them 
away like you're doing.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:26.450
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:30.630
I was just trying to say that 
scary things are happening

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:35.780
while you're all hiding... down here...

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:41.350
I know that things have changed 
since the New York incident.

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:47.160
But right now, there's something 
that terrifies us even more...

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:51.290
That people's hearts are 
filled with prejudice.

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:57.180
I will protect Vy from that world. 
I won't let them touch her.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:02.390
And everyone here, as well. 
This is my atonement.

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:08.980
That is why I was given this power 
to see only the Reflected.

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:14.560
It just seems like you're trapped 
in your own shell, too.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:20.530
If we all combined our powers, we could...

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:22.070
What could we do?

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.700
Well...

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:26.560
But if we just stay here—

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.980
So that means Eleanor...

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:56.210
What should I do?

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:58.310
You don't have to worry.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:00.360
Of course I have to worry!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:07.360
Merchant and Trader... They're different.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.440
What do you mean?

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:12.240
They're not killing Reflected.

00:14:12.550 --> 00:14:14.900
They're keeping them safe.

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:15.550
Huh?

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:49.160
So your friends are Reflected, too?

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:52.300
Those two are fine. Unlike me, they're—

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:55.400
They're in danger! If they're in 
this city, they'll be found out!

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:58.170
Still, they're strong.

00:14:58.170 --> 00:14:59.350
You don't understand!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:04.510
Nothing is more dangerous than 
people with fear in their hearts.

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:08.690
Will they be able to fight against 
normal human beings?

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:09.930
Well...

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:13.680
But if they're up against Reflected,

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.930
humans won't hesitate.

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:26.770
You seem to know a lot about them.

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:29.780
Why don't you continue what 
you were saying earlier?

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:34.980
And I'm stuck in this role 
again... So annoying.

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:38.430
You guys should just... You should just...

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:44.090
Tell us where they are. 
Tell us where all those Refs are!

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:45.670
No! Don't tell them!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.420
You're a Ref sympathizer, too?

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:53.900
The wetlands... Deep in the wetlands!

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.200
We found out where they are.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:09.830
We'll find those two and hide them here.

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:14.210
But this place might be 
found, too... Eventually...

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:19.070
I'm all for us working together.

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:20.560
But...

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:25.710
Rather than hide, I think it'd be 
better to accept reality and face it.

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:28.070
What are we going to face?

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:32.340
The Reflected that you mentioned 
who are plotting something?

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:35.860
Or the prejudice in people's hearts?

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:37.790
I don't know.

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:41.840
But I don't want to run away. That's all.

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:46.360
She's trembling.

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:50.650
Her instincts might have 
picked up on something.

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:51.890
Does that mean...

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.170
Something is coming closer.

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:56.860
Mischa! We're going outside!

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:07.430
What's going on?

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:19.090
Are you okay? Hey...

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:22.180
That place is where

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:27.450
the people of this town risked 
their lives to hide our ancestors.

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:29.510
It's a sacred place.

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:32.520
I'm so sorry, Michael!

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.480
X-On!

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.750
You hide in the mansion.

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:59.520
I told you, I won't run away.

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:26.440
A world without Refs, my ass.

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:28.830
How dare you trick me this whole time?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:32.420
Warren Dallas... So it was you.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.300
I beg you. Turn back.

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:37.020
I have no intention of fighting you.

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:41.480
So you let that girl survive, after all.

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:45.590
You've got some nerve as a merchant, 
withholding merchandise like that.

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:50.440
I'll go ahead and do what you couldn't.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:51.870
Don't do this!

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:55.940
I don't want to fight the 
police... no, anyone!

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:59.370
I see... That means you're also a Ref.

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:03.090
So you were lying about that, too...

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:13.750
Vy!

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:20.270
Vy...

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:28.700
That's...

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:30.710
Don't, Vy!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:35.750
You monster.

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:40.610
Stop! Don't do this, Vy!

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:43.950
Stop this... Don't hurt them.

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:46.290
You can't do this.

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:48.410
You were always so kind.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:52.740
Vy, I'm the one to blame... For everything.

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:56.560
So if you're going to direct your 
anger at anyone, direct it at me!

00:19:57.870 --> 00:20:00.220
Vy, I'm so sorry.

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:02.080
Michael!

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:06.320
No!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:17.330
Michael...

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:20.420
Michael, I love you.

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:30.720
Wait! Vy!

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:53.420
Volt.

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:57.770
Electric attack!

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:06.810
You're...

00:21:09.590 --> 00:21:11.330
She's just like you.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:14.610
If I can get something out of it,

00:21:14.610 --> 00:21:17.940
I don't mind being friendly 
with some Reflected.

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:19.070
Vy...

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:29.220
Since Steel Ruler was here, I don't think 
they were only after those two.

00:22:29.820 --> 00:22:30.820
The hideout!

00:22:31.800 --> 00:22:36.820
Please let them all out into this world.

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:38.700
So we can all fight together!

00:22:40.410 --> 00:22:41.920
Don't look at me.

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:47.300
I'll do it.

00:22:54.900 --> 00:22:56.340
Someone!

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:00.310
Answer me!

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:01.890
Michelle!

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:10.340
No...

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Next Time 
San Antonio

00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Narration: Stan Lee
